      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Service Oriented Architecture - the primary style here*.\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Service Oriented Architecture - the primary style here*.\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "DTOzi8vly3P7JfarCb0Lo",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 347,
      "y": 219,
      "width": 999.679443359375,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a1",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1094971012,
      "version": 203,
      "versionNonce": 166582588,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1789401006318,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Service - some code owned by a team that has private state (date), and exposed\n            behaviors (methods) through some interface for others to access or manipulate that state.\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Service - some code owned by a team that has private state (date), and exposed\n            behaviors (methods) through some interface for others to access or manipulate that state.\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "N9QSBG6N0ZtfidFO3cVu7",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 415,
      "y": 398,
      "width": 829.7593383789062,
      "height": 125,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a2",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 272831164,
      "version": 413,
      "versionNonce": 1954160828,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1789401204937,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "\"Monolith\" - a slur. What you call code that isn't factored into services.\n    - shouldn't be a slur. I'll get to that.\n    - one service/application, all in the same repository, shipped and tested as a unit.\n    - working in a monolith is AWESOME because everything is early bound.\n    - managing a monolith is a problem because of deployment concerns.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "\"Monolith\" - a slur. What you call code that isn't factored into services.\n    - shouldn't be a slur. I'll get to that.\n    - one service/application, all in the same repository, shipped and tested as a unit.\n    - working in a monolith is AWESOME because everything is early bound.\n    - managing a monolith is a problem because of deployment concerns.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "NIQvyN7hInLQiq3e1z2BE",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -240,
      "y": 268,
      "width": 606.6795043945312,
      "height": 300,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a3",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2112309124,
      "version": 358,
      "versionNonce": 1331163313,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1789573428561,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Feedback loops. (Cybernetics - Ship's helms man - Kubernetes )\n\nInner Loop\n    - on your machine, what you are\n      looking at and interacting with.\n\nOuter loop\n    - everywhere else, ci/cd pipelines,\n      test environments, etc.\n\nthe only environment that makes us money: Production.\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Feedback loops. (Cybernetics - Ship's helms man - Kubernetes )\n\nInner Loop\n    - on your machine, what you are\n      looking at and interacting with.\n\nOuter loop\n    - everywhere else, ci/cd pipelines,\n      test environments, etc.\n\nthe only environment that makes us money: Production.\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
